X-WR-CALNAME:Jubilee disruption
BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://tfl.gov.uk/tube-dlr-overground/status/?Input=&lineIds=&dateTypeSelect=Future%20date&direction=&startDate=2026-08-28T17:58:00&endDate=2026-08-29T17:00:00">Disruption map.</a>\n\nThe emergency services are responding to a large fire near the railway at Neasden. Until it is made safe\, Jubilee and Metropolitan line services are unable to run through the area. Services will be curtailed as follows until early afternoon on Saturday 29 August 2026. Please check before you travel.\r\n\r\nJUBILEE LINE: No service between Wembley Park and Willesden Green and SEVERE DELAYS on the rest of the line.\r\n\r\nMETROPOLITAN LINE: No service between Harrow-on-the-Hill and Aldgate and SEVERE DELAYS on the rest of the line.
DTEND:20260829T170000Z
DTSTART:20260828T175800Z
SUMMARY:Jubilee: Part Suspended
UID:2568b239-a215-4450-822e-28bfe89060c6@2568.org
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://tfl.gov.uk/tube-dlr-overground/status/?Input=&lineIds=&dateTypeSelect=Future%20date&direction=&startDate=2026-08-29T04:34:32&endDate=2026-08-30T00:29:00">Disruption map.</a>\n\nJubilee Line: No service between Wembley Park and Willesden Green and SEVERE DELAYS on the rest of the line while emergency services respond to a large fire near the railway at Neasden. Tickets will be accepted on London Buses\, DLR\, Elizabeth line\, Mildmay line\, C2C and Thameslink services. Service is not expected to resume fully until 18:00 today at the earliest. Please check before you travel. 
DTEND:20260830T002900Z
DTSTART:20260829T043432Z
SUMMARY:Jubilee: Severe Delays
